### Smart Emotion Learning API Tests
### Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code to run these

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check
GET {{base}}/health

###

### Register a new user
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "email": "student@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get all courses
GET {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get adaptive content for course 1 (confused emotion)
GET {{base}}/courses/1/content?emotion=confused
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get emotion history
GET {{base}}/emotion/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get analytics summary
GET {{base}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ML API Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health
